--- !u!114 &2065195101
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2065195100}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb0115ab550010248ad569d0116cf47c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  DialogueLines:
  - Hmm hm Hmm
  - Oh! Hello little one. Are you here for a dress?
  - No?
  - "That\u2019s just as well. Not many people come to the shop nowadays."
  - The war has taken most of the capable men including my brothers.
  - "Oh, it\u2019s alright. I suppose in a way I got what I wanted, the freedom to
    run the shop on my own. "
  - "Of course, it\u2019s not like I wanted my parents to be taken too."
  - "They\u2019re not fighting, just making clothes for the soldiers. It\u2019s mostly
    been quiet, well with the exception of one customer..."
  - "I\u2019m sure there\u2019s more to it than what I see, but even so, it\u2019s
    quite scary having a grown man yell with such rage."
  - "Ah, I\u2019m so sorry little one, I\u2019m sure you don\u2019t care to know
    all that. But even so, this was quite the pleasant experience."
  - ' Please do come back again, I find you to be calming.'
  NPCName: Margaret
